--[[
SAIKI CHAT HUB v1.0 — FOUNDATION BUILD
Client-side Luau / executor build.
Design: soft dark surfaces, electric-blue accent, fully rounded controls,
separate left navigation dock + main window, smooth lightweight transitions.

Included in this foundation:
  * Responsive draggable combined dock/window
  * Messages / People / Profiles / Notifications / Settings navigation
  * Server / Global / DMs selector with expandable Server channels
  * Firebase anonymous authentication (legacy Saiki Chat database)
  * End-to-end Server Open Lounge text chat, last-50 rendering, 3s cooldown
  * Global/DM views wired to their paths, using conservative polling
  * GitHub sticker repository discovery + persistent local cache (executor APIs)
  * Roblox avatar thumbnails and profile picture ID mapping scaffold
  * Toggle descriptions, low-power setting, unload cleanup

Important:
  * Assumes an executor with request, loadstring, and optional file APIs.
  * Client-side cooldowns/identity checks are not security boundaries.
  * Firebase rules must permit the intended authenticated reads/writes.
  * This is a foundation release; social follow actions, tier permissions,
    announcement publishing, aura model mounting, and full DM contact discovery
    are intentionally left for the next integration pass rather than faked.
]]

